[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6117645479","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124391#issuecomment-6117645479","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124391","id":6117645479,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbKPcpw","user":{"login":"MattParkerDev","id":61717342,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzE3MzQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61717342?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev","html_url":"https://github.com/MattParkerDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-12T04:16:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T04:16:25Z","body":"> Disclaimer: AI used to write the benchmark code, plot with matplotlib and summary\r\n\r\nBenchmarked this change against typed GDScript using seven interop-heavy workloads.\r\n\r\nBoth C# arms use the same Debug benchmark game DLL with Optimize=false. Only the optimization setting of Godot’s managed assemblies changes.\r\n\r\nResults: enabling optimization improved all seven workloads by 1.50×–7.45×. Optimized C# was faster than GDScript in 5 of 7 workloads, compared with 2 of 7 before.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2160\" height=\"1656\" alt=\"godot-interop\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ab71e489-7fb6-45a5-b39e-84924b653b1b\" />\r\n\r\n### Relative performance\r\n\r\n“2× faster” means half the execution time.\r\n\r\n| Workload | Unoptimized C# vs GDScript | Optimized vs unoptimized C# | Optimized C# vs GDScript |\r\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| Typed properties | 3.19× faster | **2.07× faster** | 6.61× faster |\r\n| Variant properties | 2.15× slower | **1.50× faster** | 1.43× slower |\r\n| Dynamic call | 1.84× slower | **2.00× faster** | 1.09× faster |\r\n| Array read/write | 4.87× slower | **1.65× faster** | 2.95× slower |\r\n| Dictionary read/write | 6.15× slower | **7.45× faster** | 1.21× faster |\r\n| Signal roundtrip | 2.05× slower | **2.18× faster** | 1.06× faster |\r\n| Mixed node update | 1.03× faster | **3.82× faster** | 3.92× faster |\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Raw timings — nanoseconds per workload iteration</summary>\r\n\r\nLower is better. Each iteration may contain multiple API calls.\r\n\r\n| Workload | GDScript | C# Optimize=false | C# Optimize=true | Time reduction |\r\n|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| Typed properties | 112.30 | 35.21 | 17.00 | 51.73% |\r\n| Variant properties | 164.32 | 353.33 | 234.86 | 33.53% |\r\n| Dynamic call | 77.01 | 141.68 | 70.75 | 50.06% |\r\n| Array read/write | 33.92 | 165.31 | 100.00 | 39.51% |\r\n| Dictionary read/write | 57.17 | 351.67 | 47.20 | 86.58% |\r\n| Signal roundtrip | 131.64 | 270.00 | 123.70 | 54.19% |\r\n| Mixed node update | 235.44 | 229.37 | 60.11 | 73.79% |\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Workloads and methodology</summary>\r\n\r\n| Workload | Work performed per iteration |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Typed properties | Set and get a `Node3D` position using typed APIs |\r\n| Variant properties | Set/get position through cached `StringName` keys and Variant conversion |\r\n| Dynamic call | Call native `get_position` by name and consume the result |\r\n| Array read/write | Write and read one element of a typed Godot array |\r\n| Dictionary read/write | Write and read one integer key in a typed Godot dictionary |\r\n| Signal roundtrip | Emit a signal through Godot and invoke a handler in the respective language |\r\n| Mixed node update | Read/update position, set visibility, query instance ID and parent/child count, and write an array element |\r\n\r\n- Godot `4.8.dev.mono.custom_build.84a000706`; C# runtime `.NET 10.0.12`.\r\n- Windows, windowed runs without an attached debugger.\r\n- Three fresh processes per arm.\r\n- Each workload receives a one-second warmup, iteration-count calibration, and nine samples targeting 250 ms each.\r\n- Reported values are the median of the three process medians.\r\n- Nodes and containers are created before measurement. Setup, logging, and result serialization are excluded.\r\n- C# forces GC between samples, outside timing. Collections occurring during measurement remain included.\r\n- GDScript uses typed node references, arrays, and dictionaries, with equivalent API-level work and measurement settings.\r\n- Arms were measured in separate batches, rather than randomized/interleaved.\r\n\r\nThese are steady-state microbenchmarks, primarily exercising GodotSharp interop. They do not measure overall game FPS or editor performance\r\n\r\n</details>","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6117645479/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6117676651","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124391#issuecomment-6117676651","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124391","id":6117676651,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbKRWaw","user":{"login":"MattParkerDev","id":61717342,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzE3MzQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61717342?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev","html_url":"https://github.com/MattParkerDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-12T04:19:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T04:19:51Z","body":"@raulsntos Might be good to get this in for 4.8, as its a big improvement, and a very small change imo.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6117676651/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6121989367","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124391#issuecomment-6121989367","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124391","id":6121989367,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbOYk9w","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-12T10:00:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T10:00:48Z","body":"You should also measure C# build time with `Optimize` enabled/disabled, because last time I enabled it greatly increased build times for NativeAOT exports. I'm not sure how much it will affect regular Roslyn Compile time.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6121989367/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6123021221","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124391#issuecomment-6123021221","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124391","id":6123021221,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbPXjpQ","user":{"login":"MattParkerDev","id":61717342,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzE3MzQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61717342?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev","html_url":"https://github.com/MattParkerDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-12T11:06:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T11:06:22Z","body":"Are you concerned about compile time for users compiling their game, or compile time in GitHub actions CI building the engine?\n\nThis change has 0 effect on user compile time - the user's project remains Optimize false (or whatever the user has set) - it is unchanged by this PR. \n\nThis PR only changes prebuilt Godot assemblies. \n\nIf you're concerned about the latter, I'll have a look at the build times for the mono legs on this PR's CI against main or a random other PR. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6123021221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6124518732","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124391#issuecomment-6124518732","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124391","id":6124518732,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbQy9TA","user":{"login":"Delsin-Yu","id":71481700,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDgxNzAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71481700?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu","html_url":"https://github.com/Delsin-Yu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Delsin-Yu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-12T12:44:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T12:44:55Z","body":"> the user's project remains Optimize false (or whatever the user has set) - it is unchanged by this PR.\r\n\r\nOh, then that's a pure performance win then, thanks for elaborating.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6124518732/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6161969372","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124391#issuecomment-6161969372","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124391","id":6161969372,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABb0gw3A","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T05:59:00Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T05:59:00Z","body":"This should help with things like the Variant generic conversion methods, which don't get specialized without optimizations enabled.\r\n\r\nThe only negative is that disabling optimizations is useful for debugging the engine. But one can always do so with a `Directory.Build.props` file.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6161969372/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6165828722","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124391#issuecomment-6165828722","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124391","id":6165828722,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABb4MUcg","user":{"login":"MattParkerDev","id":61717342,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxNzE3MzQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61717342?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev","html_url":"https://github.com/MattParkerDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MattParkerDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T10:02:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T10:02:32Z","body":"> The only negative is that disabling optimizations is useful for debugging the engine\n\nWe could instead set Optimize true as a build arg, only for the publish path, although I don't believe the build script currently has any specific publish path. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6165828722/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6171561424","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124391#issuecomment-6171561424","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124391","id":6171561424,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABb9qN0A","user":{"login":"neikeq","id":7718100,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTgxMDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7718100?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq","html_url":"https://github.com/neikeq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/neikeq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T15:10:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T15:10:05Z","body":"That might mess up incremental builds when building both from the python script and msbuild/IDE intermittently, as one does publishing and the other doesn't.\nI wouldn't deliberate too much about this. The `Directory.Build.props` file is fine, and we could always figure something else latter.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6171561424/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]